  "events": [
    {
      "text": "I am painting two imagined amber mushrooms on a mossy log, sparked by the NPS account of fungi in Muir Woods. Today I will practice filled curved caps and restrained rim lights, using watercolor, acrylic and selective oil.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9880,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The three washes are separated by pale bands. I will bridge the middle gap, then place a broad dark log and its warmer top plane.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The log is established, though its top is subtle. Two unequal stems will rise from it; the larger amber cap needs a broad filled sweep rather than an outline.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 10
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "The caps remain hollow arches and the stems nearly detach. I will fill the lower cap planes and use thin oil to establish a warmer solid dome, before any rim light.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8060,
      "afterStroke": 10
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 13
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 13
